ul weapons, they are used for balance when walking sideways.',50.00,50.00,'krabby.png',28,0,0,0),(99,'Kingler',1.3,60,99,99,1,'The large pincer has 10000 hp of crushing power. However, its huge size makes it unwieldy to use.',50.00,50.00,'kingler.png',NULL,0,0,0),(100,'Voltorb',0.5,10.4,100,100,1,'Usually found in power plants. Easily mistaken for a POKé BALL, they have zapped many people.',NULL,NULL,'voltorb.png',30,1,0,0),(101,'Electrode',1.2,66.6,101,101,1,'It stores electric energy under very high pressure. It often explodes with little or no provocation.',NULL,NULL,'electrode.png',NULL,0,0,0),(102,'Exeggcute',0.4,2.5,102,102,1,'Often mistaken for eggs. When disturbed, they quickly gather and attack in swarms.',50.00,50.00,'exeggcute.png',NULL,1,0,0),(103,'Exeggutor',2,120,103,103,1,'Legend has it that on rare occasions, one of its heads will drop off and continue on as an EXEGGCUTE.',50.00,50.00,'exeggutor.png',NULL,0,0,0),(104,'Cubone',0.4,6.5,104,104,1,'Because it never removes its skull helmet, no one has ever seen this POKéMON\'s real face.',50.00,50.00,'cubone.png',28,0,0,0),(105,'Marowak',1,45,105,105,1,'The bone it holds is its key weapon. It throws the bone skillfully like a boomerang to KO targets.',50.00,50.00,'marowak.png',NULL,0,0,0),(106,'Hitmonlee',1.5,49.8,106,106,1,'When in a hurry, its legs lengthen progressively. It runs smoothly with extra long, loping strides.',100.00,0.00,'hitmonlee.png',NULL,0,0,0),(107,'Hitmonchan',1.4,50.2,107,107,1,'While apparently doing nothing, it fires punches in lightning fast volleys that are impossible to see.',100.00,0.00,'hitmonchan.png',NULL,0,0,0),(108,'Lickitung',1.2,65.5,108,108,1,'Its tongue can be extended like a chameleon\'s. It leaves a tingling sensation when it licks enemies.',50.00,50.00,'lickitung.png',NULL,0,0,0),(109,'Koffing',0.6,1,109,109,1,'Because it stores several kinds of toxic gases in its body, it is prone to exploding without warning.',50.00,50.00,'koffing.png',35,0,0,0),(110,'Weezing',1.