rupted while it is miming, it will slap around the offender with its broad hands.',100.00,0.00,'mr-mime.png',42,0,0,0),(123,'Scyther',1.5,56,123,123,1,'With ninja-like agility and speed, it can create the illusion that there is more than one.',50.00,50.00,'scyther.png',NULL,1,1,0),(124,'Jynx',1.4,40.6,124,124,1,'It seductively wiggles its hips as it walks. It can cause people to dance in unison with it.',0.00,100.00,'jynx.png',NULL,0,0,0),(125,'Electabuzz',1.1,30,125,125,1,'Normally found near power plants, they can wander away and cause major blackouts in cities.',75.00,25.00,'electabuzz.png',NULL,0,1,0),(126,'Magmar',1.3,44.5,126,126,1,'Its body always burns with an orange glow that enables it to hide perfectly among flames.',75.00,25.00,'magmar.png',NULL,0,1,0),(127,'Pinsir',1.5,55,127,127,1,'If it fails to crush the victim in its pincers, it will swing it around and toss it hard.',50.00,50.00,'pinsir.png',NULL,0,0,0),(128,'Tauros',1.4,88.4,128,128,1,'When it targets an enemy, it charges furiously while whipping its body with its long tails.',100.00,0.00,'tauros.png',NULL,0,0,0),(129,'Magikarp',0.9,10,129,129,1,'In the distant past, it was somewhat stronger than the horribly weak descendants that exist today.',50.00,50.00,'magikarp.png',20,0,0,0),(130,'Gyarados',6.5,235,130,130,1,'Rarely seen in the wild. Huge and vicious, it is capable of destroying entire cities in a rage.',50.00,50.00,'gyarados.png',NULL,0,0,0),(131,'Lapras',2.5,220,131,131,1,'A POKéMON that has been over­ hunted almost to extinction. It can ferry people across the water.',50.00,50.00,'lapras.png',NULL,0,0,0),(132,'Ditto',0.3,4,132,132,1,'Capable of copying an enemy\'s genetic code to instantly transform itself into a duplicate of the enemy.',NULL,NULL,'ditto.png',NULL,0,0,0),(133,'Eevee',0.3,6.5,133,133,1,'Its genetic code is irregular. It may mutate if it is exposed to radiation from element STONEs.',87.50,12.50,'eevee.png',NULL,1,0,1),(134,'Vaporeon',1,29,134,134,1,'Lives close to water. It